        },
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "BORN FROM ROOTS, RITUAL AND RESTORATION.",
            "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 16,
            "heading_tag": "automatic"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>SEVA was born from a deeply personal return to ancestral care. During pregnancy, founder Ashleen experienced severe neck injury, followed by stress, pain and significant hair loss. In search of healing, she found herself returning to the traditions she grew up with — weekly hair oiling rituals, botanical ingredients and the grounding self-care practices passed down through her Indian heritage.</p><p>What began as a personal act of restoration became something much greater. Through old family wisdom, traditional ingredients and a desire to create something deeply meaningful, SEVA was created as a tribute to care, culture and connection. The name SEVA means selfless service — to give, care and serve without expecting anything in return. It also holds a personal connection to Ashleen’s late grandmother, a devoted woman whose life was guided by love, service and devotion.</p><p>Every SEVA product carries that same intention.</p><p>To care deeply. To restore gently. To honour where we come from, while creating rituals for the way we live today.</p>",
            "text_font_size": "body-medium",
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading",
        "heading",
        "text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/11a8717a239b52eb3e59f626fd80c611c0760d5f-v2.jpg",
