        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>SEVA is more than beauty. It is a philosophy of care. In Sanskrit, Seva speaks to the act of selfless service — giving from a place of love, purpose and devotion. For us, that meaning is carried through every product, every ritual and every moment of care.</p><p>We believe beauty should feel like coming home to yourself. It should not be rushed, disconnected or purely surface-level. It should support the body, calm the mind and honour the rituals that have carried wisdom across generations.</p><p>SEVA exists to transform beauty into something deeper.</p>",
