        "heading_font_size": "heading-medium",
        "description": "<p>For generations, hair oiling has been practised throughout Indian culture as more than a beauty routine. It is a ritual of nourishment, connection and care.</p><p>It is the feeling of oil warmed between the palms. The slow rhythm of hands moving across the scalp. The quiet pause before washing. The memory of mothers, grandmothers and daughters passing down knowledge through touch. At SEVA, we honour this ritual through a modern lens.</p><p>Our products are created to help you care for the scalp as the foundation of healthier-looking hair, while also creating space for nervous system restoration, emotional grounding and intentional self-care. Because haircare can be more than maintenance.</p>",
